  "name": "Coin Change (DP)",
  "summary": "A bounded 0/1 bitset prefers exact lethal damage, then the lowest lethal total through 1,024 power. Above that range, it selects the strongest bolts first until they kill. An exact kill can turn weak spare bolts into block, limited to the largest attack intent among surviving foes; other spare attacks go to the next foe.",
